{%- comment -%}
  Prince Tires — Price Match Policy (owner terms 2026-11-14):
  written quote, local independent Calgary shops only, tire price only.
  Same layout as pt-policy-returns / terms-of-use (shared .pt-policy styles).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign effective_date = section.settings.effective_date | default: 'November 14, 2026'
  assign quote_days     = section.settings.quote_days     | default: '30'
-%}

<article class="pt-policy">
  <header class="pt-policy__head">
    <p class="pt-policy__eyebrow">Policy</p>
    <h1 class="pt-policy__title">Price Match Policy</h1>
    <p class="pt-policy__meta">Effective: {{ effective_date }} &middot; Last updated: {{ effective_date }}</p>
  </header>

  <nav class="pt-policy__toc" aria-label="Table of contents">
    <p class="pt-policy__toc-title">Contents</p>
    <ol>
      <li><a href="#price-match-1">1. Overview</a></li>
      <li><a href="#price-match-2">2. How to get a price match</a></li>
      <li><a href="#price-match-3">3. What the quote must show</a></li>
      <li><a href="#price-match-4">4. Which shops we match</a></li>
      <li><a href="#price-match-5">5. What we match</a></li>
      <li><a href="#price-match-6">6. What we don't match</a></li>
      <li><a href="#price-match-7">7. Checking a quote</a></li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <section id="price-match-1" class="pt-policy__section">
    <h2>1. Overview</h2>
    <p>We'll match the tire price from any local independent tire shop in Calgary, on the same tire, when you show us a written quote.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="price-match-2" class="pt-policy__section">
    <h2>2. How to get a price match</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Get a written quote from the other shop.</li>
      <li>Bring it to either of our shops, or text us a photo of it.</li>
      <li>We check the quote and match the tire price.</li>
    </ol>
  </section>

  <section id="price-match-3" class="pt-policy__section">
    <h2>3. What the quote must show</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The shop's name, address and phone number</li>
      <li>The date. Quotes older than <strong>{{ quote_days }} days</strong> don't count.</li>
      <li>The exact tire: brand, model, size, load index and speed rating</li>
      <li>The price per tire</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We match the same tire only. A different model or size, even from the same brand, doesn't qualify.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="price-match-4" class="pt-policy__section">
    <h2>4. Which shops we match</h2>
    <p>The shop must be an <strong>independent tire shop in Calgary</strong> with a storefront that sells tires to the public.</p>
    <p>We don't match big-box stores, warehouse clubs, dealerships, national chains or online sellers.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="price-match-5" class="pt-policy__section">
    <h2>5. What we match</h2>
    <p>We match the <strong>price of the tires only</strong>. Installation, balancing, the tire levy and other fees are charged at our normal prices.</p>
  </section>

  <section id="price-match-6" class="pt-policy__section">
    <h2>6. What we don't match</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Rebates, mail-in offers, bundles, clearance, or another shop's promotions</li>
      <li>Staff, family, friends or wholesale prices</li>
      <li>Quotes from a shop you own or work for</li>
      <li>Tires the other shop doesn't have in stock at the quoted price</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section id="price-match-7" class="pt-policy__section">
    <h2>7. Checking a quote</h2>
    <p>We may call the other shop to confirm the price and stock before we match. We can decline any quote we can't confirm.</p>

    <p class="pt-policy__contact" style="margin-top:2.5rem;">
      <strong>Questions about a price match?</strong><br>
      42 Ave SW: <a href="tel:+14034524283">(403) 452-4283</a><br>
      Edmonton Trail NE: <a href="tel:+18253954024">(825) 395-4024</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</article>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Price Match Policy",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "text", "id": "effective_date", "label": "Effective date", "default": "November 14, 2026" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "quote_days", "label": "Quote must be newer than (days)", "default": "30" }
  ],
  "presets": [ { "name": "Price Match Policy" } ]
}
{% endschema %}
